{"id":"torrey:adoption","source":"torrey","name":"Adoption","slug":"adoption","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Explained — 2Co 6:18.","refs":[["2Cor",6,18,6,18]]},{"text":"Is according to promise — Ro 9:8; Ga 3:29.","refs":[["Rom",9,8,9,8],["Gal",3,29,3,29]]},{"text":"Is by faith — Ga 3:7,26.","refs":[["Gal",3,7,3,7],["Gal",3,26,3,26]]},{"text":"Is of God’s grace — Eze 16:3-6; Ro 4:16,17; Eph 1:5,6,11.","refs":[["Ezek",16,3,16,6],["Rom",4,16,4,16],["Rom",4,17,4,17],["Eph",1,5,1,5],["Eph",1,6,1,6],["Eph",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Is through Christ — Joh 1:12; Ga 4:4,5; Eph 1:5; Heb 2:10,13.","refs":[["John",1,12,1,12],["Gal",4,4,4,4],["Gal",4,5,4,5],["Eph",1,5,1,5],["Heb",2,10,2,10],["Heb",2,13,2,13]]},{"text":"Saints predestinated to — Ro 8:29; Eph 1:5,11.","refs":[["Rom",8,29,8,29],["Eph",1,5,1,5],["Eph",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Of Gentiles, predicted — Ho 2:23; Ro 9:24-26; Eph 3:6.","refs":[["Hos",2,23,2,23],["Rom",9,24,9,26],["Eph",3,6,3,6]]},{"text":"The Adopted are gathered together in one by Christ — Joh 11:52.","refs":[["John",11,52,11,52]]},{"text":"New birth connected with — Joh 1:12,13.","refs":[["John",1,12,1,12],["John",1,13,1,13]]},{"text":"The Holy Spirit is a Witness of — Ro 8:16.","refs":[["Rom",8,16,8,16]]},{"text":"Being led by the Spirit is an evidence of — Ro 8:14.","refs":[["Rom",8,14,8,14]]},{"text":"Saints receive the Spirit of — Ro 8:15; Ga 4:6.","refs":[["Rom",8,15,8,15],["Gal",4,6,4,6]]},{"text":"A privilege of saints — Joh 1:12; 1Jo 3:1.","refs":[["John",1,12,1,12],["1John",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"Saints become brethren of Christ by — Joh 20:17; Heb 2:11,12.","refs":[["John",20,17,20,17],["Heb",2,11,2,11],["Heb",2,12,2,12]]},{"text":"Saints wait for final consummation of — Ro 8:19,23; 1Jo 3:2.","refs":[["Rom",8,19,8,19],["Rom",8,23,8,23],["1John",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"Subjects saints to the fatherly discipline of God — De 8:5; 2Sa 7:14; Pr 3:11,12; Heb 12:5-11.","refs":[["Deut",8,5,8,5],["2Sam",7,14,7,14],["Prov",3,11,3,11],["Prov",3,12,3,12],["Heb",12,5,12,11]]},{"text":"God is long-suffering and merciful towards the partakers of — Jer 31:1,9,20.","refs":[["Jer",31,1,31,1],["Jer",31,9,31,9],["Jer",31,20,31,20]]},{"text":"Should lead to holiness — 2Co 6:17,18; 7:1; Php 2:15; 1Jo 3:2,3.","refs":[["2Cor",6,17,6,17],["2Cor",6,18,6,18],["2Cor",7,1,7,1],["Phil",2,15,2,15],["1John",3,2,3,2],["1John",3,3,3,3]]},{"text":"Likeness to God. — Mt 5:44,45,48; Eph 5:1.","refs":[["Matt",5,44,5,44],["Matt",5,45,5,45],["Matt",5,48,5,48],["Eph",5,1,5,1]]},{"text":"Child-like confidence in God. — Mt 6:25-34.","refs":[["Matt",6,25,6,34]]},{"text":"A desire for God’s glory. — Mt 5:16.","refs":[["Matt",5,16,5,16]]},{"text":"A spirit of prayer. — Mt 7:7-11.","refs":[["Matt",7,7,7,11]]},{"text":"A love of peace. — Mt 5:9.","refs":[["Matt",5,9,5,9]]},{"text":"A forgiving spirit. — Mt 6:14.","refs":[["Matt",6,14,6,14]]},{"text":"A merciful spirit. — Lu 6:35,36.","refs":[["Luke",6,35,6,35],["Luke",6,36,6,36]]},{"text":"An avoidance of ostentation. — Mt 6:1-4,6,18.","refs":[["Matt",6,1,6,4],["Matt",6,6,6,6],["Matt",6,18,6,18]]},{"text":"Safety of those who receive — Pr 14:26.","refs":[["Prov",14,26,14,26]]},{"text":"Confers a new name — See Titles of Saints. Nu 6:27; Isa 62:2; Ac 15:17.","refs":[["Num",6,27,6,27],["Isa",62,2,62,2],["Acts",15,17,15,17]]},{"text":"Entitles to an inheritance — Mt 13:43; Ro 8:17; Ga 3:29; 4:7; Eph 3:6.","refs":[["Matt",13,43,13,43],["Rom",8,17,8,17],["Gal",3,29,3,29],["Gal",4,7,4,7],["Eph",3,6,3,6]]},{"text":"Is to be pleaded in prayer — Isa 63:16; Mt 6:9.","refs":[["Isa",63,16,63,16],["Matt",6,9,6,9]]},{"text":"Joseph’s sons. — Ge 48:5,14,16,22.","refs":[["Gen",48,5,48,5],["Gen",48,14,48,14],["Gen",48,16,48,16],["Gen",48,22,48,22]]},{"text":"Moses. — Ex 2:10.","refs":[["Exod",2,10,2,10]]},{"text":"Esther. — Es 2:7.","refs":[["Esth",2,7,2,7]]},{"text":"Israel. —Ex 4:22; Ho 11:1; Ro 9:4.","refs":[["Exod",4,22,4,22],["Hos",11,1,11,1],["Rom",9,4,9,4]]},{"text":"Solomon. — 1Ch 28:6.","refs":[["1Chr",28,6,28,6]]}],"